      "description": "SignalFlow Studio turns product notes, public links, GitHub repository context, and supported text files into editable channel-specific drafts using a real model provider route. It supports bring-your-own-model generation, versioned browser-local campaign saving, authoritative Markdown and JSON exports, and confirmed-only publishing through configured official connectors.",
